WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.377
<v Priya Raman>(Priya Raman) Marcus, it's Priya on the SOC night shift. Sorry for the late call. I need a containment decision on an insider threat alert.

00:00:09.077 --> 00:00:10.636
<v Marcus Bell>(Marcus Bell) No problem. Go ahead.

00:00:11.336 --> 00:00:16.779
<v Priya Raman>(Priya Raman) It's Elliot Marsh, the Halvorsen Systems contractor on AURORA. He resigned six days ago.

00:00:17.479 --> 00:00:28.672
<v Priya Raman>(Priya Raman) Tonight he badged into Building 7 at 22:41, signed in at 22:52, opened KESTREL documents he isn't on the roster for, and printed 340 pages at 23:40.

00:00:29.372 --> 00:00:33.538
<v Marcus Bell>(Marcus Bell) KESTREL? He's never worked on that program. Is he still in the building?

00:00:34.238 --> 00:00:47.088
<v Priya Raman>(Priya Raman) As far as we can tell, yes. Cohere North's investigation recommends quiet containment. Block printing, USB and file transfers on his workstation, preserve the evidence under legal hold, and add a 30 day watch rule.

00:00:47.788 --> 00:00:50.974
<v Priya Raman>(Priya Raman) No account or badge changes, so nothing tips him off.

00:00:51.674 --> 00:00:55.648
<v Marcus Bell>(Marcus Bell) Agreed. Keep it quiet and reversible. Containment is approved.

00:00:56.348 --> 00:01:01.947
<v Marcus Bell>(Marcus Bell) Brief counterintelligence before anything he could notice, and bring the decision group in first thing.

00:01:02.647 --> 00:01:06.678
<v Priya Raman>(Priya Raman) Will do. I'll set containment to approved and log the decision in the case.

00:01:07.378 --> 00:01:11.110
<v Marcus Bell>(Marcus Bell) Thanks, Priya. Call me if he tries to leave with anything.
